silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_02_enrichment_by_type_information_concrete_anchor_3 silm:hasExample "In 'EnrichmentAnchorMittens', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Mittens occupies the center column of both rows in the enrichment diagram, instantiated as the running cat: Mrs Hendersons silver-furred domestic cat carrying veterinary record 77 (visit 2024-11-01), microchip ID 2018, weighed 4.1kg. Each adjacent typed hom-set Hom_O_01(X, Mittens) and Hom_O_01(Mittens, Y) carries exactly the named typed arrow shown in the figure; each hom-set is small and explicitly enumerated, illustrating the Set-enrichment property.." .
